Android Application Reverse Engineering Methodologies

Part 14 — Android Enterprise, Banking & Large-Scale Business Application Reverse Engineering Methodology (Beginner → Expert)

> Goal: Learn how to systematically understand large-scale Android applications such as enterprise systems, banking apps, healthcare platforms, government services, e-commerce, logistics, and productivity suites. These applications emphasize business workflows, modular architecture, offline synchronization, security, and maintainability rather than real-time simulation.



> Core Principle:
Enterprise applications are business process engines. Recover the business domains and workflows before individual implementations.




